    {
      "id": 9000,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [60, 100],
      "size": [560, 860],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 36,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Effects: change your clip with an LTX 2.3 IC-LoRA",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Effects: change your clip with an LTX 2.3 IC-LoRA\n\nChanges your own clip with one LTX 2.3 IC-LoRA that an effect picks, such as day to night, clean plate or water, at your clip's shape, length and frame rate, with your clip's sound. The effect sets the adapter, its strength and both prompts. Built from Rosesfield's reframe graph, which follows Comfy's template template_ltx2_3_lora_video_outpainting.\n\n## Models\n\n- [ltx-2.3-22b-dev-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-fp8/resolve/main/ltx-2.3-22b-dev-fp8.safetensors): LTX 2.3 22B dev, fp8, [LTX-2.x Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x).\n- [ltx-2.3-22b-distilled-lora-384.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3/resolve/main/ltx-2.3-22b-distilled-lora-384.safetensors): LTX 2.3 distilled LoRA, [LTX-2.x Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x).\n- The effect's IC-LoRA, one of [clean plate](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Clean-Plate), [day to night](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Day-To-Night) or [water simulation](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Water-Simulation), [LTX-2.x Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x).\n- [gemma_3_12B_it.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ltx-2/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/gemma_3_12B_it.safetensors): Gemma 3 12B text encoder, [Gemma Terms of Use](https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms).\n\n## Custom node pack\n\n- [ComfyUI-LTXVideo](https://github.com/Lightricks/ComfyUI-LTXVideo) at commit 82bd963cdeb66d023bed8c99324a307020907ef8, for LTXAddVideoICLoRAGuide. Comfy Cloud installs it.\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
